
"smart_sources:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/culture/Culture - The Dowry Ceremony.md": {"path":"Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/culture/Culture - The Dowry Ceremony.md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"jwgggb","at":1777331817895},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1777002481304,"size":4682,"at":1777331817922,"hash":"jwgggb"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,31],"#Culture - The Dowry Ceremony":[33,34],"#A sacred, private Althenian rite performed before a public wedding ceremony. Its secrecy means few unmarried individuals know the full details.":[35,48],"#A sacred, private Althenian rite performed before a public wedding ceremony. Its secrecy means few unmarried individuals know the full details.#{1}":[36,48],"#[ Clergy-Only Secret Doctrine ]":[49,53],"#[ Clergy-Only Secret Doctrine ]#{1}":[50,53],"#A key ceremonial item presented to the bride during the Dowry Rite, symbolizing her sacred duties.":[54,61],"#A key ceremonial item presented to the bride during the Dowry Rite, symbolizing her sacred duties.#{1}":[55,61]},"outlinks":[],"metadata":{"type":"lore","status":"active","priority":50,"tags":["#lorebook"],"keys":["dowry","dowry ceremony","wedding rite","althenian wedding","sacred panties","panties","holy underwear","dowry item","sanctum matrice"],"refine_keys":["althenian","wedding","bride","ceremony","church","sacred","priestess"],"position":"before","depth":4,"scanDepth":1,"summary":"**What is this?** An entry detailing the secretive, multi-stage Althenian Dowry Ceremony—a private pre-wedding rite that purifies the couple and symbolically transfers Althena’s blessings (the \"dowry\") to the bride, preparing her to become a \"True Wife.\" Includes the clergy-only secret of a corrupted, groomless version that omits \"The Service\" stage, used for supremacist or predatory arrangements. Also defines the \"Holy Panties\" (Sacred Panties), a custom-consecrated garment worn during and after the rite, symbolizing purity, procreative duty, and marital covenant.\n\n**When to select:** When a female character undergoes a private pre-wedding ritual in Althenian culture; when clergy discuss ceremonial corruption or heretical practices; when a character dons or is gifted symbolic undergarments tied to divine duty; when exploring the power dynamics of the Althenian church.\n\n**Key relationships:** Althena (goddess, source of blessings), bride (central participant), groom (partner), priestess (performers), Oracle (optional, channels divine blessing). Known owners: Florence, Charlotte (both received corrupted version)."},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/culture/Culture - The Dowry Ceremony.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"1e6s4gn","at":1777331817895},"key":"Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/culture/Culture - The Dowry Ceremony.md#---frontmatter---","lines":[1,31],"size":1547,"outlinks":[],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
