 multi-stage Althenian Dowry Ceremony—a private pre-wedding rite that purifies the couple and symbolically transfers Althena’s blessings (the \"dowry\") to the bride, preparing her to become a \"True Wife.\" Includes the clergy-only secret of a corrupted, groomless version that omits \"The Service\" stage, used for supremacist or predatory arrangements. Also defines the \"Holy Panties\" (Sacred Panties), a custom-consecrated garment worn during and after the rite, symbolizing purity, procreative duty, and marital covenant.\n\n**When to select:** When a female character undergoes a private pre-wedding ritual in Althenian culture; when clergy discuss ceremonial corruption or heretical practices; when a character dons or is gifted symbolic undergarments tied to divine duty; when exploring the power dynamics of the Althenian church.\n\n**Key relationships:** Althena (goddess, source of blessings), bride (central participant), groom (partner), priestess (performers), Oracle (optional, channels divine blessing). Known owners: Florence, Charlotte (both received corrupted version)."},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/culture/Culture - The Dowry Ceremony.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":"1e6s4gn","at":1777331880122},"embeddings":{"TaylorAI/bge-micro-v2":{"vec":[-0.00448966,0.04482498,0.02056083,-0.0325293,0.00203933,0.04545272,0.05071371,-0.02037304,0.02791863,0.04910279,-0.01535161,-0.00212829,0.01966336,-0.00318621,0.03206779,0.00110028,-0.00195903,0.06589328,-0.11674749,0.02887633,0.15026346,-0.04680856,-0.06136023,-0.01629099,0.00570693,-0.01904174,-0.0435469,-0.04702982,-0.03395728,-0.155827,-0.05656024,0.01257933,-0.05602368,0.05551919,-0.03367091,-0.03834409,-0.10647139,0.02956056,-0.02266298,0.04100041,0.02865051,-0.00949785,-0.04126965,-0.00537366,0.00944678,-0.09575938,0.03386797,0.03404921,-0.05339112,-0.04480285,-0.05209595,0.04486158,-0.00962938,0.0656321,0.04130573,0.01